<title>CANADA: DBRS puts Chauvco under review.</title>
<headline>DBRS puts Chauvco under review.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominion Bond Rating Service said on Monday it placed Chauvco Resources Ltd under review with developing implications after Chauvco said that it would undertake a process to explore strategic alternatives designed to enhance shareholder value.</p>
<p>DBRS said the company would remain under review until &quot;such time as events, if any, unfold, and we are in a position to assess the ramifications from a credit rating perspective.&quot;</p>
<p>DBRS said it currently rated Chauvco's commercial paper at R-1 (low).</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
